Subject: [PATCH] oneplus-instantnoodlep: package DisplayPort audio

Add kernel patches 0100-0103 for display audio and playback restart.
Expose 48 kHz stereo playback as the HDMI UCM device. Advance the
kernel package to release 78 and UCM to release 4.

Signed-off-by: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
